url: "https://chatsicaps.vercel.app"
abstract: >-
  Web-based chatbot for preliminary scabies screening through 
  interactive conversation. SICAPS extracts clinical keywords 
  from user responses, calculates risk scores using a deterministic 
  scoring engine, and provides personalized recommendations. 
  Designed for santri (students) at Islamic boarding schools 
  (pesantren) in Indonesia, where scabies prevalence is high 
  due to communal living conditions.
